     <p>For the purpose of this privacy policy, "We", "Us", "Our", "Company" means MIEMBRO CHIT FUND PRIVATE LIMITED and "You", "Your" and "User" means any person who accesses or uses our website/application.This website is owned and operated by the Company. This Data Policy applies to www.investifya.com, the website("Website") and the 'investifya' Mobile Application ("App"). This Data Privacy Policy describes practices for handling User information collected in connection with the services rendered by this Website and App.</p>

<p>MIEMBRO CHIT FUND PRIVATE LIMITED and their affiliates are committed to protecting and respecting User privacy and providing with the information, options and choices necessary for you to control how we use your information. This Privacy Policy describes how the Website collects and uses personal information to provide services operated by or on behalf of the Website/App. This Privacy Policy is to be read along with the Terms of Use available at</p>
<p>https://investifya.com/terms-and-conditions</p>

<h3>1. <strong>This Policy Sets Out:</strong></h3>

<ul>
